ition-all duration-300 text-white/90 group-hover:text-white\" style=\"text-shadow:0 0 8px #743f77, 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)\">Contact Us</span></a></div><div class=\"nav:hidden flex items-center\"><button class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 rounded-lg text-white transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #743f77, #9a5d9d);box-shadow:0 0 20px #743f77;border:2px solid #743f77\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Open main menu</span><div class=\"w-6 h-6 relative flex flex-col justify-center space-y-1\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-white rounded-full transition-all duration-300 \" style=\"filter:drop-shadow(0 0 5px #743f77) drop-shadow(0 0 10px #743f77)\"></span><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-white rounded-full transition-all duration-300 \" style=\"filter:drop-shadow(0 0 5px #743f77) drop-shadow(0 0 10px #743f77)\"></span><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-white rounded-full transition-all duration-300 \" style=\"filter:drop-shadow(0 0 5px #743f77) drop-shadow(0 0 10px #743f77)\"></span></div></button></div></div></div></nav><main class=\"min-h-screen\"><div class=\"min-h-screen\"><section class=\"relative py-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#743f77] to-[#653767] text-white\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url(&#x27;/bg-pattern.svg&#x27;)] opacity-20\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">Who is FranklinOne</h1><div class=\"w-24 h-1 bg-white mx-auto mb-8\"></div><p class=\"text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto text-gray-100 opacity-90\">Your trusted partner in cybersecurity and networking solutions since 2000.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"relative h-[500px] rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50px)\"><img alt=\"FranklinOne Office\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"rounded-lg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Dubai_Marina_Skyline.jpg/1200px-Dubai_Marina_Skyline.jpg\"/></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">What Sets Us Apart</h2><div class=\"w-16 h-1 bg-[var(--color-primary)] mb-8\"></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-md bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10 text-[#f15a22]\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"ml-4\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-gray-900\">Technical Expertise</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-base text-gray-600\">Our team of certified engineers provides deep technical knowledge and implementation experience.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-md bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10text-[var(--color-primary)]\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"ml-4\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-gray-900\">Regional Presence</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-base text-gray-600\">With offices in 10 countries across Asia-Pacific, we provide local support with global capabilities.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-md bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10 text-[#f15a22]\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"ml-4\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-gray-900\">Best-of-Breed Solutions</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-base text-gray-600\">We partner with leading technology vendors to provide the best solutions for our clients&#x27; needs.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-md bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10 text-[#f15a22]\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"ml-4\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-gray-900\">24/7 Technical Support</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-base text-gray-600\">Round-the-clock support services to ensure your critical systems stay operational.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-gray-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">OUR APPROACH</h2><div cl