to mb-6\"><svg class=\"w-8 h-8\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">Implement</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">We provide professional implementation, integration, and ongoing support to ensure your solutions deliver long-term value.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-[var(--color-primary)] text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">Ready to work with FranklinOne?</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-100 opacity-90 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto\" style=\"opacity:0\">Contact us today to discuss your security and networking needs.</p><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><a class=\"bg-whitetext-[var(--color-primary)] hover:bg-gray-100 font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-md text-lg transition duration-300 ease-in-out\" href=\"/contact-us/\">Get in Touch</a></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-[#743f77] to-[#633567] text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"col-span-1\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-4 text-white\">FranklinOne</h3><p class=\"text-white mb-4\">Our company was established by a team of highly experienced professionals who have excelled in the distribution business for years, deeply understand the core values of being a true distributor</p><div class=\"flex space-x-4\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white hover:text-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300\"><span class=\"sr-only\">LinkedIn</span><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M19 